154ND3cL Similarly, 1970Jo20 also in ({+252}Cf SF decay)                        
154ND3cL report two isomeric decays, 162.5 (T{-1/2}=2.1 |ms) and                
154ND3cL 169.9 (T{-1/2}=1.7 |ms) both in mass 154. In (n,F|g) a 169.8 {I3}      
154ND3cL |g ray was identified at this (4-) isomer, but no 162 |g ray. Overall, 
154ND3cL despite the missing evidence, the evaluator would tentatively place    
154ND3cL the 162 transitions also to this isomer                                
