154PM c  2018Bh07 was compiled for XUNDL database by B. Singh  (McMaster)       
154PM c  2018Bh07 includes |g-ray studies for {+152}Pm to {+158}Pm isotopes     
154PM2c  from {+9}Be({+238}U,F|g) and {+252}Cf SF decay experiments that        
154PM2c  have been combined by 2018Bh07:                                        
