154PM3c  using VAMOS++ and EXOGAM array at GANIL facility                       
154PM c  Deduced high-spin levels.                                              
154PM c  2. {+252}Cf SF decay: measured E|g and |g|g using GAMMASPHERE array    
154PM2c  comprised of 101 Compton-suppressed Ge detectors at LBNL facility.     
154PM3c  Deduced high-spin levels.                                              
154PM cG E$2018Bh07 state typical uncertainty of 0.2 keV for E|g around 200 keV,
154PM2cG 0.5 keV around E|g=500 keV, and 1 keV around E|g=1 MeV but list the E|g
154PM2cG values rounded off to nearest keV. Based on the above statement, the   
154PM3cG evaluator reassigns 0.2 keV for the E|g<200 keV and 0.5 keV for        
154PM4cG E|g<500 keV of {+154}Pm (which are all                                 
154PM4cG less than 500 keV).                                                    
154PM cG RI$According to 2018Bh07 the uncertainties are from fitting procedure  
154PM cL E$From least-squares fit to E|g data                                   
