154SM c  Measurements have observed J|p=1- levels (1976Me17, 1977Be05) and      
154SM2c       1+ levels (1984Bo43, 1990Zi06, 1991Ri02). Other measurements      
154SM3c       have been done to deduce the nuclear radius, isomer shift, and    
154SM4c       deformation parameters (1970Wh02,1976Co08,1987MeZR).              
154SM c  Articles on theory of 1+ states include: 1986Fa01, 1986No07, 1986Va28, 
154SM2c       1987Ca28, 1987Ca31, 1987Ci04, 1987Ha19, 1987Ha38, 1987Ra30,       
154SM3c       1988No05, 1989Ra01, 1990Fa09, 1990Li07, 1990Ri02, 1990Vl01,       
