154SM c  Experimental methods:                                                  
154SM c  1993Zi05: enriched (98.6%) target with bremsstrahlung photons of       
154SM2c       2 to 10 MeV from injector of the S-DALINAC accelerator.           
154SM3c       Scattered |g's measured at 90|' and 127|' with Ge detectors.      
154SM c  1990Zi06: (|g,|g'). Identifies six 1+ levels in a spectrum.            
154SM2c       Level energies estimated by evaluator from spectrum.              
154SM c  1984Bo43: (e,e') on enriched (98.7%) target with E(e)=25, 29,          
154SM2c       41, and 48 MeV, FWHM=21-35 keV. Report 3200 keV 1+ level.         
154SM c  1977Be05: natural Sm target with capture |g's from the V(n,|g)         
154SM2c       reaction to excite a 6465, 1- level. Measured |g(|q) and          
154SM3c       linear polarization for some |g's and level width. Methods        
154SM4c       described in 1979Mo19.                                            
154SM c  1977HoZF: (e,e') with E(e-) from 80 to 300 MeV. The elastic            
154SM2c       and inelastic cross sections were measured.                       
154SM c  1976Me17: natural Sm target with 1.2-3.8 MeV bremsstrahlung.           
154SM2c       |g's were measured by two Ge detectors at 96|' and 126|'.         
154SM3c       |g(|q) and linear polarization measured and width deduced         
154SM4c       for the 921, 1- level.                                            
154SM c  1976Co08: (e,e') with E(e-)=35 to 110 MeV on enriched (99.5%)          
154SM2c       target. Scattered electrons measured at 92.5|', 110|',            
154SM3c       127.5|' and 145|' in a double-focusing spectrometer               
154SM4c       and an array of 20 Si(Li) detectors in the focal plane.           
