154GD5cG 1971La11,1971Wh01,1972Go35,1973Ob01,1977Gu10,1983Gi07,1983Le19,1992Ak03
154GD6cG ,1996Al31) as well as from |a values obtained from the |g intensities  
154GD7cG and the relative ce intensities in the {+154}Sm(|a,4n|g) reaction      
154GD8cG (1974Go30), {+154}Tb |e decay (1971Ri08,1972Vy04,1977Ya04), {+154}Eu   
154GD9cG |b{+-} decay (1968Br20,1968Ha28,1968Ng01,1969An01,1971Ru05,1972Na21),  
154GDacG and {+153}Gd(n,|g) (1996SpZZ).                                         
154GD cG M$See {+150}Nd({+9}Be,5n|g) for additional multipolarity assignments,  
154GD2cG deduced by evaluator, but not adopted.                                 
154GD cG MR$Although several of these references do not state the convention    
154GD2cG used for the sign of |d, the evaluator has tried to convert them all   
154GD3cG to the Nuclear Data Sheets convention. The signs were not changed for  
154GD4cG 1973Ob01, 1977Gu10, 1978We08, 1989Ki10; the signs were changed for     
154GD5cG 1969Ha01, 1969Ha36, 1969HaZJ, 1969Va09, 1970Ru09, 1971La11, 1971Wh01,  
154GD6cG 1972Go35, and 1982Da11.                                                
