154GD cL $From the compilation of 1973Mu14 there are 48 n resonances below 1~keV
154GD2cL in {+154}Gd; the related measurements are given in 1974Ra23. See       
154GD3cL 1987Ma13 for data on 134 resonances from 0.48 to 2.76~keV. For a recent
154GD4cL publication of n resonances for this, and other nuclides, see 2018MuZZ.
154GD cL $For the labeling used to identify the cranked shell-model             
154GD2cL configurations, see the ({+9}Be,5n|g) data set. For a discussion of the
154GD3cL various band crossings in the cranked shell-model, see 1989Mo20        
154GD4cL ({+9}Be,5n|g).                                                         
154GD cL E$From a least-squares fit to the listed |g-ray energies with          
154GD2cL |h{+2}{norm}=2.13 greater than |h{+2}{critical}=1.15. The              
