154GD CL BAND(A)$K{+|p}=0+ ground-state band. a=21.35, b=-0.14 (from 0+, 2+     
154GD2cL and 4+ levels). The large b value suggests that the usual expansion in 
154GD3cL powers of J(J+1) does not give a good description of the band          
154GD4cL structure.                                                             
154GD CL BAND(B)$First excited K{+|p}=0+ band. Probable |b-vibrational band.    
154GD2cL a=24.24, b=-0.30 (from 0+, 2+ and 4+ levels). Assignment as a |b band  
154GD3cL based on deduced |r{+2}(E0) value (2001Ga02). The large b value        
154GD4cL suggests that the usual expansion in powers of J(J+1) does not give a  
154GD5cL good description of the level energies.                                
154GD CL BAND(b)$Aligned two-neutron-quasiparticle band.                        
154GD2cL Configuration=(|n 3/2[651])+(|n 3/2[651]) (cranked shell-model         
154GD2cL configuration AB in {+150}Nd({+9}Be,5n|g) dataset)                     
154GD2cL crosses the g.s. band at ~h|w=0.31~MeV (near the 18+ level).           
154GD CL BAND(C)$K{+|p}=2+ |g-vibrational band. a=23.63, b=-0.222,              
154GD2cL A{-4}=-0.0216 (from 2+, 3+, 4+, and 5+ levels). The large values of b  
154GD3cL and A{-4} suggest that the usual rotational formula does not provide   
154GD4cL a good description of the level energies.                              
154GD CL BAND(D)$K{+|p}=1- odd-spin octupole-vibrational band. At higher spins, 
154GD2cL it can be ascribed to                                                  
154GD2cL Configuration=(|n 3/2[651])+(|n 3/2[532]) (cranked shell-model         
154GD2cL configuration AE in {+150}Nd({+9}Be,5n|g) dataset)                     
154GD CL BAND(d)$K{+|p}=1- even-spin octupole-vibrational band.                 
154GD2cL Most of the J|p values from (|a,2n|g),(|a,4n|g) that are not justified 
154GD2cL in dataset are adopted tentatively.                                    
154GD CL BAND(E)$Second excited K{+|p}=0+ band. Intruder band.  band is         
154GD2cL associated with a smaller deformation (2003Ku19).  Proposed by these   
154GD3cL authors as a "pairing isomer".                                         
154GD CL BAND(F)$K{+|p}=2+ odd-spin band. 2011Sh07 do not give the 8+ member of 
