154GD2cL Except for the common 7- and (8-) levels of this band, the upper       
154GD2cL levels differ in (|a,2n|g),(|a,4n|g) and                               
154GD2cL {+150}Nd({+9}Be,5n|g) datasets. Given here are the levels from         
