154GD    COULOMB EXCITATION                                      25NDS    202503
154GD  H TYP=FUL$AUT=N. NICA$CIT=NDS 200, 2 (2025)$CUT=22-Aug-2022$             
154GD D  DATA SET UPDATED (FEBRUARY, 2008) BY CW REICH TO ADD REFERENCE TO      
154GD2D   2004To09 INCORPORATE THEIR DATA, REVISE SOME LIFETIMES, AND MODIFY    
154GD3D   SOME COMMENTS.                                                        
154GD D  UPDATED (SEPT., 1997) BY CW REICH TO INCLUDE BE(L) DATA FROM 1993Su16  
154GD2D  ON THE 2+ MEMBERS OF THE GS, |b AND |g BANDS, THE 3- MEMBERS OF THE    
154GD3D  O- AND 1- OCTUPOLE BANDS AND THE 1- MEMBER OF THE 0- OCTUPOLE BAND.    
154GD4D  ALSO, THE STRUCTURE OF SOME OF THE COMMENTS HAS BEEN MODIFIED.         
154GD c  The B(EL) values given here are from 1970RiZY, 1977Ro08, 1977Ro26,     
154GD2c    1977Sc33, 1977Wo02, 1977Wo03 and 1993Su16; and the lifetimes         
154GD3c    are from 1972Ru07, 1975Wa15, 1977Si18 and 2004To09. Other            
154GD4c    Coulomb-excitation measurements include 1960El07, 1964Al25,          
154GD5c    1965Yo04, and 1970Be36.                                              
154GD c  Experimental methods:                                                  
154GD c  1960El07: Coulomb excitation with p and d, with E=4.5 for p and d.     
154GD2c       p' and d' measured in magnetic spectrometer.                      
154GD c  1964Al25: excitation with {+14}N, E=37 MeV; |g measured.               
154GD c  1965Yo04: excitation with {+16}O, E=43.5 MeV; |g measured              
154GD2c       with NaI detector and scattered {+16}O with Si(Au) detectors.     
154GD c  1970Be36: {+16}O, E |? 36 MeV; measured |g(|q,H) with                  
154GD2c       recoil-into-gas technique for g factor.                           
154GD c  1970RiZY: |a, E(|a)=15 MeV. |a' measured in magnetic                   
154GD2c       spectrometer, and ({+16}O,{+16}O'), E({+16}O)=30-56 MeV.          
154GD3c       Report B(E2) to 2+ of |b- and |g-vibrational bands.               
154GD c  1972Ru07: {+35}Cl, E=100 MeV; measured lifetimes by                    
154GD2c       Doppler-shift, recoil-distance method for 4+, 0+, and 6+ levels.  
154GD c  1975Wa15: {+35}Cl, E=130-135 MeV; measured lifetimes by                
154GD2c       Doppler-broadened lineshape method for 6+, 8+ and 10+ levels.     
154GD c  1977Ro08: |a, E(|a)=11-17 MeV; |a' measured in magnetic                
154GD2c       spectrometer; report B(E2) for three 2+ levels.                   
154GD c  1977Ro26: same as 1977Ro08; report M(E2) for first 2+ level.           
154GD c  1977Sc33: |a, E(|a)=11.8 MeV; |a' measured with Si(Au) detector;       
154GD2c       report M(E2) and M(E4) for first 2+ and 4+ levels.                
154GD c  1977Si18: same as 1975Wa15; same results as 1975Wa15.                  
154GD c  1977Wo02: |a, E(|a)=11.8 MeV; |a' measured with Si(Au)                 
154GD2c       detector. Report M(E2) and M(E4) for first 2+ and 4+ levels.      
154GD c  1977Wo03: same as 1977Wo02; report B(E2) to 2+ of |b- and              
154GD2c       |g-vibrational bands, B(E2) from first 2+ to second               
154GD3c       0+, and B(E3) to 3- level.                                        
154GD c  1993Su16: {+58}Ni, E=228 MeV, {+48}Ti, E=178 MeV,                      
154GD2c       and {+32}S, E=118 MeV; |g's measured using 20                     
154GD3c       Compton-suppressed Ge detectors of the Nordball system in         
154GD4c       coincidence with backscattered particles which were detected      
154GD5c       in 5 position-sensitive Si detectors and one annular Si           
154GD6c       detector.                                                         
154GD c  2004To09: {+32}S, E({+32}S)=110~MeV. Enriched (98%) target. |g's       
154GD2c  detected in the Euroball detector placed at 0|' with respect to the    
154GD3c  beam axis together with four additional high-efficiency Ge detectors at
154GD4c  a backward angle of 144|'. Backscattered particles were detected by    
154GD5c  photodiode cells. Measured lifetimes of 6 levels using the the         
154GD6c  recoil-distance Doppler-shift method.                                  
154GD D  Note that the first three lifetime references (1972Ru07, 1975Wa15,     
154GD2D     and 1977Si18) are from the same group.                              
154GD cG E         From 1977Si18.                                               
154GD cL E(Q)      Nominal value from Adopted Levels; authors do                
154GD2cL      not give this level energy.                                       
