154GD  H TYP=FUL$AUT=N. NICA$CIT=NDS 200, 2 (2025)$CUT=22-Aug-2022$             
154GD c  2006Me25: {+156}Gd(p,t), E(p)=25~MeV. Enriched target, enrichment not  
154GD2c  given. Outgoing tritons measured at 5|', 17.5|' and 30|' using a Q3D   
154GD3c  magnetic spectrograph. FWHM=4-6~keV for E(t)=15-20~MeV. Authors report 
154GD4c  and discuss only 0+ states, which are identified from L=0 transitions  
154GD5c  established from angular-distribution data. List 16 such states, three 
154GD6c  of which are tentative and 4 of which were previously known.           
154GD c  2006Me13: an earlier report from the same group as that of 2006Me25.   
154GD c  1973Fl04: {+156}Gd(p,t), E(p)=18~MeV. Enriched (|>95%) target. Tritons 
154GD2c  detected using photographic plates in the focal plane of a magnetic    
154GD3c  spectrograph. FWHM=12~keV. t(|q) measured at |q=15, 22.5, 30, 37.5, 45,
154GD4c  and 60|'.                                                              
154GD c  Other (p,t) studies: 1972El07; 1973Oo01.                               
154GD cL $In the tabulation of their results, 1973Fl04 list levels at 1241,     
154GD2cL 1253, 1293, 1418 and 1509, but show only upper limits for their        
154GD3cL formation cross sections. The evaluator has thus assumed that these    
154GD4cL levels are not observably populated in (p,t) and have not included them
154GD5cL here.                                                                  
154GD cL E$Values reported to the nearest 0.1~keV are from 2006Me25. Others are 
154GD2cL from 1973Fl04.                                                         
154GD cL J$From deduced L values. These are consistent with the adopted values. 
154GD cL L         Deduced from angular distribution of outgoing                
154GD2cL  tritons. Some are given explicitly in 1973Fl04, others                
154GD3cL  deduced by evaluator from J|p reported by 1973Fl04. Those of          
154GD4cL  2006Me25 are from DWBA analysis of angular-distribution data at       
154GD5cL  angles of 5, 17.5 and 30|'.                                           
154GD CL S$LABEL=(d|s/d|W)(|mb/sr)                                              
