154GD  H TYP=FUL$AUT=N. NICA$CIT=NDS 200, 2 (2025)$CUT=22-Aug-2022$             
154GD c  2013Be38 and 2014BeZX were compiled for the XUNDL database by          
154GD2c  M. S. Basunia (LBNL)                                                   
154GD c  2013Be38, 2014BeZX: E|<4.5 MeV bremsstrahlung photon beam              
154GD2c  scattering on 0.579 g Gd{-2}O{-3} powder target surrounding with       
154GD2c  1.572 g Al disc used for photon flux calibration. Scattered photons    
154GD4c  detected by three large-volume HPGe detectors, at polar angles 90|'    
154GD5c  (two detectors) and 130|' (one detector) relative to incoming photon   
154GD6c  beam axis. Populated J|p=1+ scissors mode                              
154GD6c  state at 2934 keV and measured E|g and                                 
154GD7c  resonant photon-scattering cross sections (using {+27}Al calibration), 
154GD8c  deduced reduced transition strengths (with |g-ray branching ratios from
154GD9c  {+154}Tb |e decay from same publications).                             
154GD cG E,RI$From 2014BeZX.                                                    
154GD CG RI$LABEL=|G{-f}/|G{-0}                                                 
154GD cG RI$Photon branching relative to g.s. branch for each level             
154GD CG TI$LABEL=I{-s,f} eVb                                                   
154GD cG TI$Integrated effective cross section (as defined on                   
154GD2cG page 2 of 2013Be38).                                                   
154GD PN                                                                     6  
154GD  L 0.0          0+                                                        
154GD  L 123.1        2+                                                        
154GD cL E,J$from {+154}Gd Adopted Levels                                       
154GD  G 123.1                                                                  
154GD cG E$rounded value from {+154}Gd Adopted Gammas                           
154GD  L 2934.2    6  1+                                                        
154GD cL E$identified as scissors mode state from (|g,|g') experiment (2013Be38)
154GD  G 2811          45    12                                  64       16    
