154ER3c  {+110}Pd({+48}Ti,4n|g), E({+48}Ti)=215~MeV at ATLAS and                
154ER3c  Gammasphere array of 101 HPGe detectors at ANL. Used 1 mg/cm{+2} thick 
154ER4c  {+110}Pd target on 10 mg/cm{+2} thick {+197}Au backing, with 0.07      
154ER5c  mg/cm{+2} thick Al layer in between. Measured E|g, I|g, |g|g and       
154ER2c  fractional Doppler shifts. Found SD band and three triaxial strongly   
154ER2c  deformed (TSD) bands (keV rounded-off E|g values and no I|g's)         
154ER6c  and deduced transition quadrupole moments and configurations.          
154ER7c  Comparison with cranked Nilsson-Strutinsky method without pairing.     
154ER c  2001La17: {+110}Pd({+48}Ti,4n|g), E({+48}Ti)=215~MeV. Target consisted 
154ER2c  of |a stack of two self-supporting metallic foils                      
154ER3c  (thickness=2|*500~|mg/cm{+2}) of enrichment 98.64%. Measured E|g and   
154ER4c  |g|g using the EUROBALL detector array, consisting of 13 cluster       
154ER5c  detectors, 25 Clover detectors and 26 tapered escape-suppressed        
154ER6c  detectors. Found SD and TSD-1 bands (precise E|g values with           
154ER6c  uncertainties, no I|g's)                                               
154ER c  1995Be36: {+118}Sn({+40}Ar,4n|g), E({+40}Ar)=185 MeV. Measured         
