154YB c  The information on {+154}Yb comes primarily from the study of the      
154YB2c       {+154}Lu |e decay (1988Vi02) and the in-beam studies (1993Zh10    
154YB3c       and 1996Zh09). These latter studies make extensive use of         
154YB4c       multiparticle shell-model calculations to elucidate the           
154YB5c       properties of the {+154}Yb levels.                                
