154LU cL E$There has been some question as to whether this level is the same as 
154LU2cL the level that decays via |e to {+154}Yb. In their study of the        
154LU3cL {+154}Lu |e decay, 1988Vi02 assign the |e parent level as (7+).        
154LU4cL However, the evaluator has concluded, based on the information from    
154LU5cL the in-beam studies (1993Zh10,1996Zh09) of the {+154}Yb level scheme,  
154LU6cL that the J{+|p} value of the {+154}Lu parent in the |e decay is        
154LU7cL probably not (7+) but rather is (9+) (see the discussion in the        
154LU8cL {+154}Lu |e decay dataset). Throughout this evaluation, it has been    
154LU9cL assumed that the (9+) level reported here is the same as the parent    
154LUacL state of the {+154}Lu |e decay.                                        
